WEBVTT

00:00:02.140 --> 00:00:03.430
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:06.520
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime</i>

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:11.320
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>GUNDAM</i>

00:00:12.690 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>MOBILE SUIT</i>

00:00:13.200 --> 00:00:16.280
<i>Minna ga neshizumatta yoru
In the night when everyone else was lost in their sleep...</i>

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.620
<i>Mado kara sora wo miru to
I looked at the sky through the window...</i>

00:00:18.620 --> 00:00:23.540
<i>Tottemo sugoi mono wo mita n' da
...and there I saw such a great thing!</i>

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.840
<i>Otona wa dare mo warai-nagara
All the adults told me with a great big laugh...</i>

00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:31.340
<i>Terebi no misugi to iu kedo
"You've been watching way too much television again!"</i>

00:00:31.340 --> 00:00:34.920
<i>Boku wa zettai ni zettai ni
But I would never, ever...</i>

00:00:34.920 --> 00:00:37.140
<i>Uso nanka itte 'nai
...tell any kind of lie!</i>

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:45.520
<i>Joushiki to iu megane de
This world of ours...</i>

00:00:46.140 --> 00:00:51.020
<i>Boku-tachi no sekai wa
...cannot be viewed through...</i>

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.820
<i>Nozokeya shinai no sa
...the glasses of common sense.</i>

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:58.320
<i>Yume wo wasureta
You old earthlings...</i>

00:00:58.320 --> 00:01:02.830
<i>furui chikyuu-jin yo
...who have forgotten your dreams!</i>

00:01:04.540 --> 00:01:07.830
<i>Anime Ja Nai! Anime Ja Nai!
It's not Anime! It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:10.330
<i>Fushigi na kimochi
Such a wonderful feeling!</i>

00:01:11.040 --> 00:01:12.420
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:14.340 --> 00:01:15.840
<i>Anime Ja Nai
It's not Anime!</i>

00:01:17.340 --> 00:01:20.140
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:22.010 --> 00:01:25.020
<i>Hontou no koto sa
It really is real!</i>

00:01:32.910 --> 00:01:38.000
THE ZSSA MENACE

00:01:46.220 --> 00:01:48.720
We want to go
into the colony.

00:01:48.760 --> 00:01:52.850
Mr. Damar, you told us to
let you take care of it, right?

00:01:53.180 --> 00:01:56.560
But the citizens here are
pretty disturbed already.

00:01:56.600 --> 00:01:59.570
I have no intention of
endangering the citizens here!

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:04.240
The Argama won't just stand by
if you send out a mobile suit like this.

00:02:04.320 --> 00:02:07.240
If one of the nicer homes
in the uptown area were destroyed,

00:02:07.240 --> 00:02:09.570
it'd cause a huge shock
for the residents here.

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:13.120
And what if a riot breaks out?

00:02:13.330 --> 00:02:15.910
You'd have to suppress
the media, wouldn't you?

00:02:16.120 --> 00:02:17.920
Suppress the media?

00:02:18.170 --> 00:02:20.920
Exactly. Have a look
at this estimate.

00:02:20.920 --> 00:02:22.340
Estimate?

00:02:22.340 --> 00:02:26.340
Um, Master Mashymre, maybe I should
handle the rest of this discussion.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:27.760
Yes, you're right.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.970
Still green, isn't he?

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.980
You, on the other hand,
know what I'm talking about.

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:38.770
I suppose so.

00:02:41.730 --> 00:02:43.780
I have to defeat the Zeta,

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:47.610
but I'm not sure if I can do that
without destroying a single house.

00:02:47.700 --> 00:02:52.330
Lady Haman...
What should I do?

00:02:55.500 --> 00:02:59.960
Upon my name, Mashymre Cello
will fulfill your expectations!

00:03:00.210 --> 00:03:02.790
That sincerity is what gives me
such confidence in you.

00:03:02.790 --> 00:03:04.670
My lady! If you'll excuse me.

00:03:06.130 --> 00:03:10.550
Mashymre, there are times when things
don't go as they're supposed to.

00:03:10.800 --> 00:03:14.970
Keep in mind that you can't always
do things in a purely noble manner.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:16.810
My lady!

00:03:34.370 --> 00:03:36.540
Don't you get any?

00:03:36.660 --> 00:03:40.290
Oh, that's okay!
We just ate. Right?

00:03:40.540 --> 00:03:41.210
Yeah.

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:41.920
Oh.

00:03:41.920 --> 00:03:43.960
You have so much food!

00:03:43.960 --> 00:03:48.630
And the rooms are like the ones uptown!
A/C, heat, their own baths and toilets!

00:03:48.880 --> 00:03:50.050
You already saw them?

00:03:50.130 --> 00:03:51.680
Even if the ship's a wreck...

00:03:51.680 --> 00:03:55.220
Wow! Got some
gourmet grub today, huh?

00:03:55.220 --> 00:03:57.430
Hey, pops! I've borrowed some tools.

00:03:57.430 --> 00:03:58.730
Can I have that, too?

00:03:58.730 --> 00:04:00.940
It'd be perfect as
shingles on my roof.

00:04:01.140 --> 00:04:03.440
That's the Zeta's armor plating!

00:04:03.440 --> 00:04:06.900
What's the big deal? It looks
like you can't put it back on.

00:04:07.400 --> 00:04:09.240
Who do you think
stripped it off?!

00:04:09.530 --> 00:04:11.950
Like we aren't already pushed
to the wall with repairs?!

00:04:11.950 --> 00:04:12.990
Gentlemen.

00:04:13.910 --> 00:04:15.660
I take it you liked your lunch.

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:17.040
Captain!

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:19.200
Well, it wasn't bad.

00:04:19.200 --> 00:04:23.210
Now that your stomachs are full,
I've a favor to ask.

00:04:23.210 --> 00:04:27.460
Won't you help us aboard the ship,
till the Argama leaves this colony?

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:29.340
Help you?

00:04:29.340 --> 00:04:31.930
And why would we
be leaving the colony?

00:04:31.930 --> 00:04:35.930
The La Vie En Rose is apparently
nearby. We're going to make contact.

00:04:35.930 --> 00:04:39.680
Well? I can discuss it
with your parents.

00:04:41.350 --> 00:04:43.980
We don't have
the kind of parents...

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:47.150
that you need to
discuss things with, right?

00:04:47.150 --> 00:04:52.780
Then it's a deal. Meals are on us, and you
can even work here permanently if you like.

00:04:54.070 --> 00:04:57.330
Which means we're going
out into space, right?

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:58.950
Sounds fun.

00:05:00.620 --> 00:05:01.830
Well?

00:05:01.830 --> 00:05:04.540
Yeah, it doesn't sound
like a bad deal.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.250
If I live here,
I won't have to fix my roof.

00:05:07.250 --> 00:05:08.630
And the food's good.

00:05:08.630 --> 00:05:09.760
I'm out!

00:05:09.760 --> 00:05:11.130
Why, Judau?

00:05:11.130 --> 00:05:13.930
You want to go into
space most of all!

00:05:13.930 --> 00:05:18.050
If we stayed here, we'd be
working for you people, right?

00:05:18.430 --> 00:05:20.140
For which you'd be paid.

00:05:20.220 --> 00:05:22.850
I'm not gonna be
some wage slave!

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:26.520
I prefer to live as a freelancer
and get paid by the job!

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:29.110
In return for what you're given, right?

00:05:29.110 --> 00:05:30.110
Right.

00:05:30.110 --> 00:05:32.610
Then work off that meal you ate!

00:05:32.610 --> 00:05:33.530
What?!

00:05:33.530 --> 00:05:35.530
Guys, stop eating!

00:05:35.530 --> 00:05:38.160
No lunch is worth
working for!

00:05:38.240 --> 00:05:39.530
I don't mind.

00:05:39.530 --> 00:05:40.740
Me, neither.

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:42.450
Have it your way!

00:05:42.450 --> 00:05:43.830
Leina, we're leaving.

00:05:43.830 --> 00:05:47.250
I think it'd be good for you
to work on this ship!

00:05:47.250 --> 00:05:48.420
Don't be so bossy!

00:05:50.300 --> 00:05:52.460
What are you doing?!

00:05:52.550 --> 00:05:54.630
You...
You'd hit a man in the face?!

00:05:55.840 --> 00:05:56.800
Stop it, Judau!

00:05:56.800 --> 00:06:02.180
Do you... Do you really think
we eat this well all the time?!

00:06:02.560 --> 00:06:03.850
What?

00:06:06.940 --> 00:06:09.190
Lemme go!
Do what you want!

00:06:10.020 --> 00:06:11.940
Hey! He's doing
a dine and dash!

00:06:11.940 --> 00:06:15.030
It's all right.
What about the rest of you?

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:16.450
What do you mean?

00:06:16.450 --> 00:06:17.610
You're not going with him?

00:06:17.610 --> 00:06:20.200
This is what's called
individual freedom, right?

00:06:25.960 --> 00:06:30.040
If they think they're getting child
labor for a lunch, they're dead wrong!

00:06:32.630 --> 00:06:34.710
Why, you...!

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:38.840
I'll draw them out!

00:06:41.140 --> 00:06:42.720
Am I hearing things?

00:06:42.720 --> 00:06:45.930
Now is the time to lure
the Zeta Gundam out and finish it!

00:06:47.850 --> 00:06:50.520
You're going out without
waiting for the two Gaza-Cs?

00:06:50.520 --> 00:06:54.030
I don't want them used if any
residents get caught up in this.

00:06:54.030 --> 00:06:56.860
It's too well-known
that they're our suits.

00:06:56.860 --> 00:07:00.240
Besides, even if my methods
are unscrupulous,

00:07:00.370 --> 00:07:04.040
I still want this to be
a fair, one-on-one fight!

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:06.540
Please forgive me, Lady Haman.

00:07:06.540 --> 00:07:09.210
Forgive my hesitance
to do what I think is wrong.

00:07:18.630 --> 00:07:20.260
Zssa, moving out!

00:07:32.940 --> 00:07:35.730
I'm home. Anma! Anma!

00:07:35.730 --> 00:07:38.070
Dear! What's the matter?

00:07:38.070 --> 00:07:40.280
I got more money
out of them!

00:07:40.280 --> 00:07:41.450
My!

00:07:43.330 --> 00:07:45.240
What? You're here?!

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:46.830
Welcome home.

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.710
Are the bags taken care of?

00:07:48.710 --> 00:07:51.330
Yes, sir. Everything is
in the container.

00:07:51.330 --> 00:07:54.290
Combined with what we'll get
for the house, we can go anywhere!

00:07:54.420 --> 00:07:55.630
Right!

00:07:55.630 --> 00:07:58.840
Tasting the wines of Earth
is no longer just a dream.

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.720
Wait... Where's my wine?

00:08:00.720 --> 00:08:01.430
Sir?

00:08:01.430 --> 00:08:03.430
My wine collection!

00:08:03.430 --> 00:08:06.600
I thought it'd be in the way,
so I put it in the cellar.

00:08:06.600 --> 00:08:07.640
What?!

00:08:09.140 --> 00:08:13.270
Oh, you blithering idiot!
Pack it, as well!

00:08:14.110 --> 00:08:16.730
But your departure time...

00:08:16.730 --> 00:08:18.820
We can buy wine anywhere.

00:08:18.820 --> 00:08:21.320
You think I can recreate
a collection like that?!

00:08:21.320 --> 00:08:22.820
But, sir...

00:08:22.820 --> 00:08:26.330
You can have all the furniture we've
left here! Now pack my wine!

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:28.950
As you wish.

00:08:31.040 --> 00:08:32.330
Hurry!

00:08:32.330 --> 00:08:34.040
- Dear!
- What?

00:08:34.040 --> 00:08:35.630
Isn't that too generous?

00:08:35.630 --> 00:08:38.630
None of the good stuff is left!

00:08:46.220 --> 00:08:49.310
Even if I must be unscrupulous,
I want to minimize any damage.

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:52.810
So... Perhaps I should do this
in the sparsely populated hills.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:57.650
Are you kidding me?

00:08:57.650 --> 00:08:59.230
D-Dear...!

00:08:59.820 --> 00:09:00.740
Dear!

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:06.660
Forgive me.

00:09:06.660 --> 00:09:10.160
I don't know whose house this is,
but this is all to defeat the Zeta!

00:09:12.540 --> 00:09:13.540
What?!

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:23.170
Dammit!
Gravity can be such a pain!

00:09:24.130 --> 00:09:26.300
My... My wine!

00:09:46.030 --> 00:09:47.570
What?! What's happening?!

00:09:48.910 --> 00:09:51.370
Oh, no!
The damage is spreading!

00:09:56.420 --> 00:09:57.710
It stopped.

00:09:59.840 --> 00:10:03.210
That kid! He's taking revenge for
my getting that money out of him!

00:10:03.210 --> 00:10:04.420
Unforgivable!

00:10:05.840 --> 00:10:09.220
Captain! Apparently, a new model of
mobile suit has appeared in the uptown hills.

00:10:09.220 --> 00:10:13.220
Details are sketchy, but the
damage seems to be growing!

00:10:13.220 --> 00:10:15.390
More pursuers from Axis?

00:10:15.640 --> 00:10:17.730
You should let the uptown
homes get wrecked!

00:10:17.730 --> 00:10:19.860
But it'll spread to downtown.

00:10:19.860 --> 00:10:22.030
Hospitals and schools are
right next to there, right?

00:10:22.030 --> 00:10:24.190
I wonder if my
house is safe.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:26.450
Hospitals? Kamille...

00:10:26.820 --> 00:10:28.320
What do we do, Captain?

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:31.240
Fa can't handle the Zeta...
What about the Methuss?

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:36.040
No way. It's a wreck.
It's even leaking oil.

00:10:36.040 --> 00:10:38.920
Fa, what are you doing?!
Fa, wait!

00:10:40.340 --> 00:10:41.880
I have to protect Kamille!

00:10:53.720 --> 00:10:55.060
Dammit, Fa.

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.940
You should go
after her in the Zeta.

00:10:56.940 --> 00:10:58.060
Who would go?

00:10:58.060 --> 00:11:00.770
If I had a car, I think
I could catch up with Judau.

00:11:02.940 --> 00:11:04.030
You could bring him back?

00:11:04.030 --> 00:11:05.740
Leave it to me.

00:11:07.320 --> 00:11:08.740
Hey, let's go!

00:11:08.740 --> 00:11:09.950
Gotcha!

00:11:11.120 --> 00:11:14.490
Captain, why do you keep
insisting on using this Judau kid?

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.120
That boy could be a Newtype.

00:11:17.120 --> 00:11:21.540
If you tell them that, those brats
will be even more big-headed!

00:11:21.540 --> 00:11:23.290
You have a better idea?!

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:29.130
Manack, ready the catapult!

00:11:30.090 --> 00:11:32.930
It's impossible!
Astonaige, don't be a fool!

00:11:33.510 --> 00:11:37.560
I'm going to prove to you that
Judau kid isn't anything special!

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:41.100
The Methuss?

00:11:45.820 --> 00:11:47.400
Is that the new mobile suit?

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:53.580
That isn't the Zeta!
They underestimate me.

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.450
What?

00:11:57.450 --> 00:12:00.000
Of course.
That's a decoy.

00:12:13.800 --> 00:12:17.060
Should've taken my bike!
It's back!

00:12:19.640 --> 00:12:20.850
What? There's two of them.

00:12:24.440 --> 00:12:25.190
I've got you!

00:12:28.030 --> 00:12:29.530
Now fall!

00:12:48.840 --> 00:12:49.340
Zeta!

00:12:52.050 --> 00:12:52.930
Zeta Gundam!

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:57.720
Even I can do this!

00:13:02.440 --> 00:13:05.980
In the end, you're no match
for me. Away with you!

00:13:08.730 --> 00:13:09.360
Move!

00:13:12.360 --> 00:13:13.400
How did it dodge that?!

00:13:17.490 --> 00:13:20.250
Get up! C'mon, move!

00:13:21.080 --> 00:13:23.750
Say your prayers, Zeta.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:33.420
The Zeta Gundam is shielding
that shack with its own body!

00:13:34.510 --> 00:13:38.430
The Zeta's pilot has
a chivalrous spirit as well...

00:13:42.270 --> 00:13:43.560
You can't have the Zeta!

00:13:57.070 --> 00:13:59.620
Two against one leaves me
at a disadvantage! Dammit!

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:02.450
Huh?

00:14:02.830 --> 00:14:03.790
Why is it running?

00:14:05.210 --> 00:14:06.290
Huh?

00:14:06.330 --> 00:14:08.460
Gottn!
Gottn, do you read me?

00:14:08.460 --> 00:14:09.960
Prepare the Gaza-Cs!

00:14:09.960 --> 00:14:11.960
You said you weren't using them!

00:14:11.960 --> 00:14:14.630
There's more than one enemy!
I'm have to adapt to it!

00:14:15.430 --> 00:14:18.050
- A mobile suit!
- It's another war!

00:14:22.180 --> 00:14:23.890
Hey! My bike!

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:27.650
Are you still moping about that?!
Never mind your wine!

00:14:27.810 --> 00:14:31.440
At least our belongings
are still all right!

00:14:31.440 --> 00:14:32.530
But...

00:14:32.530 --> 00:14:34.690
Benson, take our
luggage to the port.

00:14:38.530 --> 00:14:40.330
M-More are coming!

00:14:40.330 --> 00:14:41.620
D-Dear...?

00:14:46.040 --> 00:14:48.710
Our luggage!

00:14:48.830 --> 00:14:50.540
I can't breathe!

00:14:55.840 --> 00:14:57.930
Gaza-C team,
rendezvous with me!

00:14:57.930 --> 00:14:58.720
Roger!

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:01.680
We'll head back at once
and pursue the Zeta!

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:08.730
Huh? That's the
Methuss and the Zeta.

00:15:08.730 --> 00:15:10.020
What are they doing?

00:15:10.020 --> 00:15:11.520
Did they get shot down?

00:15:11.520 --> 00:15:13.440
Hey, isn't that
Judau with them?

00:15:13.440 --> 00:15:14.730
It's too much for you, pops!

00:15:14.730 --> 00:15:16.150
What was that?!

00:15:16.150 --> 00:15:17.650
Then you try it!

00:15:17.650 --> 00:15:19.990
Oh, like I'm gonna fall for that?

00:15:20.160 --> 00:15:24.990
Stop it, Fa! All he cares about
is scrapping the Zeta so he can sell it!

00:15:25.540 --> 00:15:28.120
Mr. Astonaige, wait!

00:15:28.120 --> 00:15:31.080
Up till now,
the Gundam's been piloted...

00:15:31.080 --> 00:15:33.040
by someone named
Kamille Bidan.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:35.210
He's hospitalized now.

00:15:35.210 --> 00:15:37.380
He didn't start out
as a soldier,

00:15:37.380 --> 00:15:40.510
but he fought till the
very end to save the world.

00:15:41.050 --> 00:15:44.220
I'm not asking you to go
that far, but at least...!

00:15:44.220 --> 00:15:46.220
Fa! Mobile suits!

00:15:46.220 --> 00:15:48.060
The one from before
and two Gaza-Cs!

00:15:48.560 --> 00:15:52.060
Judau! Please,
get in the Zeta Gundam!

00:15:52.060 --> 00:15:55.650
Get in, Judau.
You can handle this.

00:15:55.650 --> 00:15:57.240
You should.

00:15:57.240 --> 00:16:00.240
What's got into you guys?
Did they pay you to do this?

00:16:00.240 --> 00:16:01.700
It's a chance to
make them owe you.

00:16:01.860 --> 00:16:07.120
No! Helping the Argama fight
is worthier than working a junk dealer.

00:16:07.700 --> 00:16:08.700
Leina...

00:16:08.700 --> 00:16:10.420
I'm through with this!

00:16:11.540 --> 00:16:13.040
Guess I was wrong
about you, Judau.

00:16:13.040 --> 00:16:14.130
Meaning what?!

00:16:14.130 --> 00:16:17.130
I hate seeing you
just living for money!

00:16:20.340 --> 00:16:23.140
I'll do it! I'll do
what you want, okay?!

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:26.100
Gimme a lift!

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:28.810
Judau, you...!

00:16:29.430 --> 00:16:32.100
This is just to pay you
back for lunch, got it?!

00:16:32.940 --> 00:16:35.020
I don't like owing
people anything!

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:39.150
We're at a disadvantage here.
We'll lead them to Sector 13!

00:16:39.610 --> 00:16:41.110
Sector 13?

00:16:41.110 --> 00:16:43.320
The Methuss still works, right?

00:16:43.950 --> 00:16:46.490
Even if you can't fight,
you can still give him backup!

00:16:47.160 --> 00:16:48.160
R-Right!

00:16:51.250 --> 00:16:51.830
Let's go!

00:16:55.960 --> 00:16:57.960
So, the Zeta's the
only one that can move...

00:16:57.960 --> 00:17:00.130
What about the mobile
suit on the ground, sir?

00:17:00.130 --> 00:17:02.050
Forget it! Pursue the Zeta!

00:17:06.010 --> 00:17:07.810
Spread out and
surround the Zeta!

00:17:07.810 --> 00:17:08.850
- Roger!
- Roger!

00:17:15.020 --> 00:17:17.150
Shangri-La has places
like this inside it?

00:17:22.450 --> 00:17:24.030
Where are they coming from?

00:17:24.030 --> 00:17:25.950
I'll smoke him out with my missiles!

00:17:35.330 --> 00:17:36.880
Where are you, Zeta Gundam?

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:43.880
What?!

00:17:53.940 --> 00:17:55.600
The second one?!

00:18:16.040 --> 00:18:17.960
The pod's in the way!

00:18:25.550 --> 00:18:26.300
Dead end!

00:18:29.350 --> 00:18:30.680
There! Over there!

00:18:32.430 --> 00:18:33.560
Where's it coming from?

00:18:33.560 --> 00:18:34.560
Above you, Judau!

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:35.640
What?!

00:18:43.070 --> 00:18:43.900
Fall!

00:18:47.820 --> 00:18:48.950
Take this, Zeta!

00:18:56.410 --> 00:18:57.460
Ow...

00:18:57.540 --> 00:18:58.960
Judau, above you!

00:18:59.040 --> 00:19:00.250
Die!

00:19:15.930 --> 00:19:17.980
Now it's my turn!

00:19:24.230 --> 00:19:26.820
Stop it! If you keep this up,
we'll both be killed!

00:19:27.110 --> 00:19:28.400
What are you saying?!

00:19:28.400 --> 00:19:30.950
Lady Haman would never
forgive me if I stopped now!

00:19:32.030 --> 00:19:34.240
My rose!
My rose is broken!

00:19:36.250 --> 00:19:37.960
Why, you...!

00:19:53.680 --> 00:19:55.810
What's wrong with Judau?

00:19:55.970 --> 00:19:57.730
Hang on, I'm charging them!

00:19:57.730 --> 00:19:58.430
With this?

00:19:58.430 --> 00:19:59.640
We can do that much!

00:20:04.730 --> 00:20:05.610
Die!

00:20:15.280 --> 00:20:16.200
What?!

00:20:31.720 --> 00:20:33.760
Is it coming?

00:20:33.760 --> 00:20:36.510
Damn.
Perhaps I took him too lightly.

00:20:41.020 --> 00:20:42.350
He's leaving.

00:20:52.150 --> 00:20:54.240
Judau, thank you.

00:20:55.320 --> 00:20:56.950
It was just for my lunch.

00:20:57.080 --> 00:20:58.950
Iino, thanks.

00:20:58.950 --> 00:20:59.910
Heh...

00:20:59.910 --> 00:21:03.080
At least we got to
be useful at the very end.

00:21:03.210 --> 00:21:05.080
Here, Big Brother!

00:21:05.420 --> 00:21:06.920
Your reward.

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:10.050
Smart move! I'm starving!

00:21:13.050 --> 00:21:15.850
Now you owe them
for another meal.

00:21:17.350 --> 00:21:18.810
Exactly.

00:21:19.390 --> 00:21:22.390
Leina! Do you really hate
cooking for me that much?!

00:21:22.690 --> 00:21:23.940
That's not it.

00:21:23.940 --> 00:21:26.560
I just think it'll be better
for you to work here.

00:21:27.440 --> 00:21:30.360
But what about your schooling?

00:21:31.110 --> 00:21:34.240
If it keeps you from going bad,
I don't have to go to school!

00:21:34.610 --> 00:21:35.410
Leina...

00:21:35.410 --> 00:21:38.330
The wicked brother makes
life tough for his little sister.

00:21:38.620 --> 00:21:39.620
What was that?!

00:21:39.620 --> 00:21:42.410
You can't get mad when
someone says the truth!

00:21:43.410 --> 00:21:45.750
Message from Mr. Chimatter, sir.

00:21:45.750 --> 00:21:49.130
The La Vie en Rose is en route,
no more than one day out.

00:21:49.840 --> 00:21:51.840
From Chimatter?

00:21:52.420 --> 00:21:54.880
Is it safe for him to give us
this much information?

00:21:56.640 --> 00:21:59.470
Apparently his annoying
boss has disappeared,

00:21:59.470 --> 00:22:01.720
so things are a lot easier
for him than before.

00:22:01.720 --> 00:22:03.480
Annoying boss?

00:22:04.230 --> 00:22:06.600
I won't suffer this outrage!

00:22:06.600 --> 00:22:09.440
I'll make that little punk
pay me even more money!

00:22:09.440 --> 00:22:11.030
Go to it, dear!

00:22:16.030 --> 00:22:17.160
Oh, no...!

00:22:45.850 --> 00:22:51.520
<i>michi mo nai areta genya ni
Amidst the wasteland without any roads...</i>

00:22:53.030 --> 00:22:58.740
<i>reeru wo tsukuru no wa kurushii koto sa
...it's difficult to lay down your rails.</i>

00:23:00.950 --> 00:23:03.240
<i>dakedo
However...</i>

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:09.540
<i>tooi mukou mo shiranakucha ikenai
You've gotta know what's on the other side...</i>

00:23:09.540 --> 00:23:16.630
<i>boku-tachi wa kore kara nanda
...it's all from here on for us.</i>

00:23:16.630 --> 00:23:21.050
<i>"yume wo wasureta kodomo-tachi" to
"Children will forget their dreams"...</i>

00:23:21.050 --> 00:23:23.430
<i>hito wa iu
...is what they say.</i>

00:23:26.350 --> 00:23:33.650
<i>aa jidai ga naiteiru
Ah, the times are crying.</i>

00:23:46.140 --> 00:23:47.770
The Endra's a military ship,

00:23:47.770 --> 00:23:50.150
which means it has
capable people on board.

00:23:50.150 --> 00:23:52.860
Their ability to give
speeches during battle...

00:23:52.860 --> 00:23:55.780
to justify their actions
is kind of admirable.

00:23:55.780 --> 00:23:58.570
But when they say I have
to give my life in exchange,

00:23:58.570 --> 00:24:00.320
I tell them, "Sorry, but no."

00:24:00.320 --> 00:24:04.660
Then those Gaza-things attack
and blow a hole in the colony!

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:08.500
Next time, on Gundam ZZ:
"Gaza Storm."

00:24:08.830 --> 00:24:10.600
You'll see the battlefield of Newtypes!

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
Next Time

00:24:09.670 --> 00:24:12.800
GAZA STORM
